CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785480501
OL,3,CSouth Asian children with autism and
OL,4,CADHD are being underdiagnosed, data
OL,5,Cshows
OL,7,FWhite British children are diagnosed
OL,8,Fwith autism at more than 3.5 times the
OL,9,Frate of South Asian children, and
OL,10,Fdiagnosed with ADHD at more than four
OL,11,Ftimes the rate, according to exclusive
OL,12,Fdata, as ITV News North of England
OL,13,FReporter Amy Welch explores
OL,15,FWords by ITV News Assistant Producer
OL,16,FAkshay Raja
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/22
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785480501
OL,3,CSouth Asian children with autism and
OL,4,CADHD are being underdiagnosed, data
OL,5,Cshows
OL,7,FWestbourne Primary in Sutton seems
OL,8,Flike any other school from the
OL,9,Foutside. But for a small number of its
OL,10,Fstudents, the morning lessons look
OL,11,Fdifferent.
OL,13,FThese children make up the school's
OL,14,Fextra provision class - a bespoke
OL,15,Fsession designed for pupils who are
OL,16,Fsuspected of having special
OL,17,Feducational needs.
OL,19,FOf the 13 students in the group, ten
OL,20,Fare South Asian, and four of these are
OL,21,Fundiagnosed.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/22
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785480501
OL,3,CSouth Asian children with autism and
OL,4,CADHD are being underdiagnosed, data
OL,5,Cshows
OL,7,FOne such student is Faman, aged five,
OL,8,Fwhose family moved to the UK from
OL,9,FPakistan when he was just nine months
OL,10,Fold.
OL,12,FOn his second birthday, his mother
OL,13,Fbegan to suspect he may have autism as
OL,14,Fhe was struggling with eye contact and
OL,15,Fbecame hyper-obsessed with one
OL,16,Fspecific toy.
OL,18,FShe has been trying to get her son a
OL,19,Fformal NHS diagnosis for the last
OL,20,Fyear, but he hasn't even had an
OL,21,Fassessment yet.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/22
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785480501
OL,3,CSouth Asian children with autism and
OL,4,CADHD are being underdiagnosed, data
OL,5,Cshows
OL,7,FBut Faman is not alone. According to
OL,8,Fnew data from the University of Leeds
OL,9,Fand Born in Bradford, shared
OL,10,Fexclusively with ITV News, there is a
OL,11,Fsubstantial ethnicity inequality in
OL,12,Fautism and ADHD diagnoses.
OL,14,FSouth Asian children aged 0-18 with
OL,15,Fneurodivergent conditions are
OL,16,Fdiagnosed at a significantly lower
OL,17,Frate than their white British peers.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/22
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785480501
OL,3,CSouth Asian children with autism and
OL,4,CADHD are being underdiagnosed, data
OL,5,Cshows
OL,7,FSpecifically, white British children
OL,8,Fare diagnosed with autism at more than
OL,9,Fthree-and-a-half times the rate of
OL,10,FSouth Asian children, and they are
OL,11,Fdiagnosed with ADHD at more than four
OL,12,Ftimes the rate.
OL,14,FThe inequality is most extreme when
OL,15,Fcomparing white British boys with
OL,16,FSouth Asian girls. White British boys
OL,17,Fare diagnosed with both autism and
OL,18,FADHD at more than 10 times the rate of
OL,19,Fthe girls.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/22
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785480501
OL,3,CSouth Asian children with autism and
OL,4,CADHD are being underdiagnosed, data
OL,5,Cshows
OL,7,FUniversity of Leeds researcher Evie
OL,8,FShore says it is not simply the case
OL,9,Fthat "autism exists less" in South
OL,10,FAsian children and girls, but suggests
OL,11,Finstead that "because of the barriers
OL,12,Fthat those groups face, they're less
OL,13,Flikely to receive the diagnosis and
OL,14,Fmore likely to receive it a lot later".
OL,16,FSo, what barriers do ethnic minority
OL,17,Ffamilies face, and why do these
OL,18,Finequalities exist?
OL,20,FCultural stigma makes some parents
OL,21,Freluctant to pursue a diagnosis
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/22
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31107
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785480501
OL,3,CSouth Asian children with autism and
OL,4,CADHD are being underdiagnosed, data
OL,5,Cshows
OL,7,FThere is no word for autism in many
OL,8,FSouth Asian languages.
OL,10,FFaman's family in Pakistan speak Urdu.
OL,11,FHis mother Fazila has still not told
OL,12,Fthem about her son's suspected
OL,13,Fneurodivergence.
OL,15,FShe told ITV News they do not believe
OL,16,Fit even exists because it does not
OL,17,Ftranslate into their first language.
OL,19,F"If I go back to my country, there is
OL,20,Fno concept, there is no awareness
OL,21,Fabout autism."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/22
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31108
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785480501
OL,3,CSouth Asian children with autism and
OL,4,CADHD are being underdiagnosed, data
OL,5,Cshows
OL,7,FAnother mother who agrees with this
OL,8,Fviewpoint is Hinna, whose son Ibaad
OL,9,Falso attends Westbourne's extra
OL,10,Fprovision classes. Her younger son
OL,11,FHamad goes to a special educational
OL,12,Fneeds school, but he had to wait four
OL,13,Fyears for an autism diagnosis.
OL,15,FWhile she has been supportive of her
OL,16,Fchildren, she recognises that not all
OL,17,FSouth Asian parents share her views.
OL,19,F"I think there is a taboo in our
OL,20,Fcommunity. A lot of people will hold
OL,21,Fback on getting a diagnosis," she said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/22
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31109
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785480501
OL,3,CSouth Asian children with autism and
OL,4,CADHD are being underdiagnosed, data
OL,5,Cshows
OL,7,F"It's maybe a lack of understanding of
OL,8,Fspecial educational needs, fear of the
OL,9,Fchild being misunderstood or judged or
OL,10,Flabelled. But I think you do have to
OL,11,Fspeak up because your child does need
OL,12,Fthat support put in place for them to
OL,13,Ffeel safe, happy, to thrive."
OL,15,FLanguage barriers also make diagnosis
OL,16,Fdifficult
OL,18,FBecky Fowles is the Inclusion Lead and
OL,19,FSENCO at Westbourne Primary School.
OL,20,FShe highlights that this stigma is not
OL,21,Fexclusive to the South Asian community.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/22
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31110
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785480501
OL,3,CSouth Asian children with autism and
OL,4,CADHD are being underdiagnosed, data
OL,5,Cshows
OL,7,FFor parents who are not influenced by
OL,8,Fcultural shame, language barriers can
OL,9,Fadd an extra hurdle for non-white
OL,10,FBritish parents trying to get a
OL,11,Fdiagnosis for their children.
OL,13,F"When your doctor does then refer you
OL,14,Fthrough, or school refers you through,
OL,15,Fyou've then got a mountain of
OL,16,Fpaperwork to fill in," Miss Fowles
OL,17,Fsaid.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/22
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31111
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785480501
OL,3,CSouth Asian children with autism and
OL,4,CADHD are being underdiagnosed, data
OL,5,Cshows
OL,7,F"And that is a real barrier for some
OL,8,Fof our parents who might not speak
OL,9,FEnglish or may speak English, but not
OL,10,Fread in English or not feel confident
OL,11,Fin doing that... and that then impacts
OL,12,Ftheir ability to really get that
OL,13,Fsupport in place."
OL,15,FMiss Fowles compared the struggles of
OL,16,FSouth Asian families with her own
OL,17,Fexperiences getting her daughter
OL,18,Fdiagnosed: "As a white British mum, it
OL,19,Fwas a lot easier for me to go to the
OL,20,Fdoctor and say, I need this assessment-
OL,21,F and my voice was heard straight away."
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@RO]zD@LOU}D@gO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/22
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31112
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785480501
OL,3,CSouth Asian children with autism and
OL,4,CADHD are being underdiagnosed, data
OL,5,Cshows
OL,7,FOnce parents finally navigate the
OL,8,Fconfusing system and secure an
OL,9,Fassessment for their children, they
OL,10,Fstill report facing further barriers.
OL,12,FThe criteria for assessments "were
OL,13,Fhistorically based on white boys",
OL,14,FMiss Fowles said, explaining why white
OL,15,FBritish boys experience the highest
OL,16,Frates of diagnosis.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/22
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31113
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785480501
OL,3,CSouth Asian children with autism and
OL,4,CADHD are being underdiagnosed, data
OL,5,Cshows
OL,7,FDr Samara Ali, who has been working on
OL,8,Fclinical assessments for autism for
OL,9,Fmore than seven years, said the
OL,10,Fdiagnostic criteria are the same for
OL,11,Fall children, but that there needs to
OL,12,Fbe a greater understanding of the
OL,13,Fcultural context that families bring.
OL,15,FShe used a lack of eye contact as an
OL,16,Fexample of a potential trait of
OL,17,Fautism, but noted that in some
OL,18,Fcultures, not making eye contact may
OL,19,Fbe seen as a sign of respect.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/22
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31114
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785480501
OL,3,CSouth Asian children with autism and
OL,4,CADHD are being underdiagnosed, data
OL,5,Cshows
OL,7,FMs Shore, the lead researcher of the
OL,8,Fstudy, highlights cases where
OL,9,F"professionals assumed that because a
OL,10,Fchild was South Asian, their first
OL,11,Flanguage wasn't English", meaning
OL,12,Ftheir communication struggles were
OL,13,Fdismissed as language barriers.
OL,15,FWhy are South Asian girls
OL,16,Fdisproportionately affected?
OL,26,@qD@AOUsD@XO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/22
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31115
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785480501
OL,3,CSouth Asian children with autism and
OL,4,CADHD are being underdiagnosed, data
OL,5,Cshows
OL,7,FThe disparities are most profound for
OL,8,FSouth Asian girls, who not only face
OL,9,Fthe previously mentioned barriers, but
OL,10,Falso go under the radar because they
OL,11,Ftend to mask their conditions.
OL,13,FAsha Harkness, 37, experienced this
OL,14,Ffirst-hand. Despite struggling from a
OL,15,Fyoung age, she has only recently been
OL,16,Fdiagnosed with ADHD and is still
OL,17,Fwaiting for an autism diagnosis.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G15/22
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31116
SC,0016
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785480501
OL,3,CSouth Asian children with autism and
OL,4,CADHD are being underdiagnosed, data
OL,5,Cshows
OL,7,FShe said she used to "look to other
OL,8,Fpeople, to TV, to magazines" to
OL,9,F"basically learn how I am supposed to
OL,10,Fbe".
OL,12,FMiss Fowles compared the
OL,13,Fidentification of special interests in
OL,14,Fboys and girls.
OL,16,FWhile boys who have a specific
OL,17,Fobsession may quickly be identified as
OL,18,Fautistic, it can be seen as "normal"
OL,19,Ffor girls to become fixated on things
OL,20,Fsuch as mermaids and unicorns, she
OL,21,Fsaid.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G16/22
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31117
SC,0017
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785480501
OL,3,CSouth Asian children with autism and
OL,4,CADHD are being underdiagnosed, data
OL,5,Cshows
OL,7,FWhat impact is this having?
OL,9,FEarly diagnosis can serve as a
OL,10,Fprotective measure against mental
OL,11,Fhealth conditions in adolescence.
OL,13,FMs Harkness believes an earlier
OL,14,Fdiagnosis would have enabled her to
OL,15,Faccept her differences much earlier in
OL,16,Flife.
OL,18,FGrowing up, she began drinking
OL,19,Fexcessively to deal with social
OL,20,Finteractions, and developed an eating
OL,21,Fdisorder.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G17/22
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31118
SC,0018
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785480501
OL,3,CSouth Asian children with autism and
OL,4,CADHD are being underdiagnosed, data
OL,5,Cshows
OL,7,FShe said both habits were "coping
OL,8,Fmechanisms" to help her when
OL,9,Feverything else felt "completely out
OL,10,Fof control and overwhelming".
OL,12,F"I wouldn't have gone through life
OL,13,Fthinking there was something wrong
OL,14,Fwith me. Like I've always thought, am
OL,15,FI an alien or something?"
OL,17,FHow can the inequality be resolved?
OL,26,@oD@[OUpD@KO]qD@VOUrD@\O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G18/22
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31119
SC,0019
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785480501
OL,3,CSouth Asian children with autism and
OL,4,CADHD are being underdiagnosed, data
OL,5,Cshows
OL,7,FParents and experts are calling for
OL,8,Fincreased awareness in the South Asian
OL,9,Fcommunity, but also for better
OL,10,Funderstanding from schools and
OL,11,Fhealthcare professionals of the
OL,12,Fnuances in how neurodivergence
OL,13,Fpresents in children who are not white
OL,14,FBritish males.
OL,16,FDr Ali has urged healthcare
OL,17,Fprofessionals to develop a "cultural
OL,18,Fcompetency" to ask different questions
OL,19,Fto "understand that family's context".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G19/22
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31120
SC,0020
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785480501
OL,3,CSouth Asian children with autism and
OL,4,CADHD are being underdiagnosed, data
OL,5,Cshows
OL,7,FThis point is reiterated by Ms Shore,
OL,8,Fwho said families should have access
OL,9,Fto more culturally nuanced information
OL,10,Fabout neurodivergence, but reinforced
OL,11,Fthat clinicians and teachers should be
OL,12,Fbetter placed to identify autism and
OL,13,FADHD in children who may not exhibit
OL,14,Fcharacteristics in the historically
OL,15,Frecognised ways.
OL,17,FITV News reached out to NHS England to
OL,18,Fask whether it is providing adequate
OL,19,Fsupport to South Asian children.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G20/22
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31121
SC,0021
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785480501
OL,3,CSouth Asian children with autism and
OL,4,CADHD are being underdiagnosed, data
OL,5,Cshows
OL,7,FIt said in a statement: "The NHS is
OL,8,Fimproving access to care for people
OL,9,Fwith ADHD and autism, particularly for
OL,10,Fthose in underserved communities, and
OL,11,Fhas commissioned an independent review
OL,12,Finto the prevalence of and support for
OL,13,Fthese conditions.
OL,15,F"Following the recommendations from
OL,16,Four ADHD taskforce, we are starting to
OL,17,Fredesign local services, transform
